## Scope

- Add the minimum Django/PostgreSQL application and configuration needed for the dashboard/API.
- Encode explicit v1 payload allowlists and unknown/partial/incompatible semantics.
- Model projects, instances, enrollment, reporter credentials, current state, material events,
  App Server counters/failure groups, Work Efficiency aggregates, idempotency, and counter epochs.
- Implement pending enrollment, approval/rejection/expiry, verifier-only tokens, revocation, and rotation.
- Keep production authentication configurable and fail closed when neither OIDC nor MFA-capable local auth is configured.

## Safety Boundaries

- No secrets, credentials, live databases, backups, logs, raw diagnostics, prompts, source, paths, or commands in Git.
- No remote control or local-state mutation from the hosted service.
- No deployment or publication before the later Work5 campaign.
